<p>Downvoted, because okay, it's a town that doesn't exist, I can dig that. But then nothing happens. Two encrypted text messages? Not frightening. In fact, they kill any creep for me because they are pretty much big neon signs for HEY LOOK A CONSPIRACY.</p>
<p>And, there's nothing particularly interesting about the location, except maybe that bit about the diner.</p>
<p>And finally, it really feels like the categorization is wrong. The scip here is not the three items. Those aren't anomalous. The anomaly is the fact that we have a town that does/doesn't exist. That should be the scip.</p>

							</div>

								
